\f3\fs22 \cf4 \cb5 \strokec4 CopyEdit
\f2\fs26 \cf0 \cb1 \strokec3 \
aws secretsmanager get-secret-value --secret-id tfc-agent-token --query SecretString --output text\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf0 Then inject into your Docker run command via scripting.\
